  "as_of": "2023-05-09",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would authorise funding for ordinary annual Commonwealth services in 2023-24, including new budget measures and the continuation of existing government programs.",
   "It would provide scheduled departmental, administered and corporate entity appropriations, with a $400 million advance available for urgent expenditure meeting the stated conditions.",
   "The legislation would commence on 1 July 2023 or Royal Assent, whichever is later, alongside separate funding bills for other services and parliamentary departments."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Advance determinations would be tabled in Parliament but exempt from disallowance.",
   "Departmental appropriations would support entity functions, including staffing and operational expenditure.",
   "Funding could be credited to special accounts when their purposes match the appropriation.",
   "The appropriation legislation would repeal at the beginning of 1 July 2026."
  ],
  "affected": "Commonwealth departments and funded public entities and companies are affected.",
